{110}{[The woman behind the desk looks up. She seems upset by this disturbance from her work.] Hello @pcname@, it is very nice to meet you I am sure. Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to get back to work.}{[The woman behind the desk looks up. She seems upset by this disturbance from her work.] Hello @pcname@, it is very nice to meet you I am sure. Now, if you don't mind, I'd like to get back to work.}{}{}{}{}
{111}{Certainly.}{}{5}{}{-11}{pv800 705}
