{120}{Excuse me, Mayor [She gives him the evil eye]. I am TRYING to finalise these expenditure accounts for Grayhills before the end of the week. If I don't, then we might find the Tarant Tax Officials breathing down our necks!}{Excuse me, Mayor [She gives him the evil eye]. I am TRYING to finalise these expenditure accounts for Grayhills before the end of the week. If I don't, then we might find the Tarant Tax Officials breathing down our necks!}{}{}{}{}
{121}{[Listen]}{}{1}{}{-11}{pv800 710}
{130}{Well aren't we the arrogant so and so? Did it occur to any of you that I am busy right now? These expenditure accounts for Grayhills need to be completed and finalised for the Tarant Tax Department by the end of the week. Otherwise, we might find ourselves owing more than we can afford.}{Well aren't we the arrogant so and so? Did it occur to any of you that I am busy right now? These expenditure accounts for Grayhills need to be completed and finalised for the Tarant Tax Department by the end of the week. Otherwise, we might find ourselves owing more than we can afford.}{}{}{}{re -5}
