{140}{Oh... Er... [She looks a little uneasy]. Okay then. Let me just see here [she flips through one of the big books in front of her]. Yes, yes. The City of Grayhills can afford a small payment for your trouble. How about 200 coin?}{Oh... Er... [She looks a little uneasy]. Okay then. Let me just see here [she flips through one of the big books in front of her]. Yes, yes. The City of Grayhills can afford a small payment for your trouble. How about 200 coin?}{}{}{}{}
