{144}{200 KOIN?!? Me wan' more den dat!}{}{-4}{}{150}{}
{150}{I'm sorry but if a certain someone [she glances sideways at the Mayor] hadn't spent most, if not ALL, of the annual budget on paving the roads and putting in street lights, then we might have been able to afford a more substantial sum. Unfortunately however, Grayhills is not in the financial position to be able to afford large payments at this point in time.}{I'm sorry but if a certain someone [she glances sideways at the Mayor] hadn't spent most, if not ALL, of the annual budget on paving the roads and putting in street lights, then we might have been able to afford a more substantial sum. Unfortunately however, Grayhills is not in the financial position to be able to afford large payments at this point in time.}{}{}{}{}
