{180}{Well then, in that case, any arrangement we make now is binding. You will get NO MORE coin out of Grayhills than what you can arrange at this meeting. Do you agree to those terms?}{Well then, in that case, any arrangement we make now is binding. You will get NO MORE coin out of Grayhills than what you can arrange at this meeting. Do you agree to those terms?}{}{}{}{}
