{190}{All right then, obviously a payment of 200 coin is less than adequate for the danger you will be facing with the Mummy. As such, I believe the Town of Grayhills can arrange a special payment for you of 2,000 coin. It will require some financial work on our side, but I believe the benefits to Grayhills will be worth it. Certainly, the Mummy does not bode well for our tourist business. So, what do you say?}{All right then, obviously a payment of 200 coin is less than adequate for the danger you will be facing with the Mummy. As such, I believe the Town of Grayhills can arrange a special payment for you of 2,000 coin. It will require some financial work on our side, but I believe the benefits to Grayhills will be worth it. Certainly, the Mummy does not bode well for our tourist business. So, what do you say?}{}{}{}{}
